---
---

<section id="storitve" class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4">Naše storitve</h2>
      <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-primary"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Large feature card -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group overflow-hidden relative border border-outline-variant/10">
        <div>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6" aria-hidden="true">construction</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-headline mb-4">Klasična &amp; Panoramska okna</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-md">
            Montaža vseh tipov VELUX strešnih oken, ki vašemu podstrešju vdihnejo novo življenje.
            Izbirajte med ročnim ali električnim upravljanjem. Zagotavljamo 100-odstotno vodotesnost
            z originalnimi obrobami za vse vrste kritin.
          </p>
        </div>
        <img
          class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 w-64 h-64 object-cover grayscale opacity-10 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-all duration-500"
          alt="Panoramsko strešno okno v modernem podstrešju"
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC8bj6kYQn5h6LdzIfXs-rN2Mdt9XKvUXjXEOfnuAuF8n_cz0SXwYLjDGUIZi53nUQiZhDPTRzIks4h_drLQQ3R5IEmqt-QTycAt0Fhb4VPeswWU8LWiQNKnBBrOEQOx_h9XOptmYo2C5Fwt4pxvrX7C-M4zytxpiZRknOr7MMwUAzgEhrrzvAGEFgn5G-HmMpI-tv2-4TUIlLpm1lslhV65Ue9L_BDWOC7PUkPScrfJVv56ZYc696Nl7KTgKGfDOvbTGY9B8_AxPvi"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Svetlobniki card -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-outline-variant/10">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true">wb_sunny</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-headline mb-2">Svetlobniki</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-secondary">
          Idealna rešitev za hodnike in kopalnice brez neposrednega dostopa do svetlobe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Obrobe card -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 border border-outline-variant/10">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-4" aria-hidden="true">architecture</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-headline mb-2">Obrobe &amp; Senčila</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-secondary">
          Zagotavljamo vodotesnost z originalnimi VELUX obrobami. Montaža notranjih in zunanjih senčil po meri.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA strip -->
      <div class="bg-primary text-on-primary p-8 md:col-span-3 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-headline mb-2">Potrebujete servis obstoječih oken?</h3>
          <p class="opacity-90">Izvajamo vzdrževalna dela, menjavo tesnil in popravila.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#kontakt"
          class="bg-white text-primary px-8 py-3 font-bold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          Rezerviraj termin
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
